        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. An employee whose Leave(s) of Absence exceed(s) thirty (30) working days in an anniversary year, or whose Leave of Absence continues from one anniversary year to another, shall not accumulate seniority during that portion of such absence which exceeds thirty (30) working days; except as provided in Section D.1, above.",
