        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. An employee with two (2) or more years of continuous Company service and who is accepted for active full-time service by ACTION for such organizations as VISTA, or the Peace Corps, will be granted a Leave of Absence to perform such service for a period of up to two (2) years.",
