        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Employees returning from such Leave of Absence shall, upon clearance by the Employer's doctor, be reinstated to their former Job Classification and Division in accordance with their relative seniority, provided the employee makes application to return to work within thirty (30) calendar days following separation from the ACTION Agency.",
            "block_bbox": [
